      "message": "We do need to stabilize the ability to host a binder server inside a VM - either via this AVmPayload_runVsockRpcServer() or via RunVsockRpcServerWithFactory() or similar in libbinder.\n\nThe aim is to provide the server side API that allows the client-side API connectToVsockServer() to be useful: cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Virtualization/javalib/src/android/system/virtualmachine/VirtualMachine.java;drc\u003d7bc146c6659d5ea35a8219f5abea1f50950f4417;l\u003d771\n\nI\u0027ll set up a chat.",
